    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in the thrilling world of \u201cSurvivalist Hustle\u201d \u2014 a unique arcade 3D game with a top-down view, where the zombie apocalypse has become a familiar reality! <br />\r\nIn this game, you take on the role of a courier faced with the challenging task of delivering crates while battling legions of the undead. <br />\r\nIt\u2019s a true symphony of adrenaline and humor, with surprises at every turn!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat makes \u201cSurvivalist Hustle\u201d so engaging? The open world serves as your playground, filled with crumbling streets, abandoned buildings, and unexpected dangers around every corner. <br />\r\nExplore every nook and cranny of the city, because you never know what to expect just around the bend! <br />\r\nZombies are everywhere, but you have the chance to showcase your cleverness and survival skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOpen world<br />\r\nFun quests<br />\r\n3D graphics<br />\r\nDifficulty<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDive into \u201cSurvivalist Hustle\u201d \u2014 an arcade 3D game with a top-down view, where you play as a courier delivering crates in a zombie apocalypse. <br />\r\nFight off legions of the undead and explore an open world full of unexpected threats!",
